WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Curtains shut.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:05.780
His father says Romeo hides
away in a darkened room,

3
00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:09.360
sighing over one name: Rosaline.

4
00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:13.040
His love sounds like
this: "O brawling love!

5
00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:15.100
O loving hate!"

6
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:19.390
A few hours later, at a masked
party, he sees someone new.

7
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.600
"Did my heart love till now?

8
00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:23.540
Forswear it, sight!"

9
00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.590
One night, two loves.

10
00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.470
Is Romeo fickle, or has he changed?

11
00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:32.270
In this mission, you'll unpack his
lovesick language for Rosaline,

12
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:35.010
and meet the Italian poet Petrarch.

13
00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:38.200
You'll hear what happens to
his words when he meets Juliet.

14
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:41.870
And you'll meet a friar
who isn't convinced at all.

15
00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:46.040
Your mission: decide whether
Romeo is fickle or changed.
